{
  "tab": "gear",
  "note": "NOTE: item_id is a foreign key to items.id (item_type = gear). v0.1.2-gear: defense and weapon_damage are the typical (mid) values; defense_min/max and weapon_damage_min/max are rolled per dropped or bought instance and stored on the item (gear does not stack). A magic roll (~1/12 of gear drops) adds a prefix and 1-2 extra bonuses — see assumptions.MAGIC. Category infusion is later (Pitch Book B-003). Balance: at level 1 with 0 points, a mid-roll Meadows drop set (Meadow Blade 14×1.15 + Hide armor def 10) is about +45% attack and ~55% less damage taken from a Crow vs basic (Wooden Sword, no armor). Cloth is a weaker shop stepping-stone (mid def 6). Skill training remains the main power-up. Steel is ultra-rare. v0.1.2-descs: `desc` is player-facing flavor (no rolled ranges — those are shown as stats).",
